{"candidateAnswer":"Unlikely, he seems very rooted in his community here","evidence":"[D24:3 | 3:34 pm on 17 July, 2023] John: I heard some cool stories from an elderly veteran named Samuel. It was inspiring and heartbreaking, but seeing their resilience really filled me with hope. It reminded me why I wanted to join the military.\n[D7:2 | 8:55 pm on 25 February, 2023] John: Hey Maria! Wanted to let you know that I'm running for office again. It's been a wild ride, but I'm more excited than ever! How have you been?","itemId":"urn:uuid:1ebefbe0-7f14-52d4-99aa-7fab86092156","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b35937df469c3b6f0e673df2e8be599b7b775d4564567914a397dbb31123151f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would John be open to moving to another country?","referenceAnswer":"No, he has goals specifically in the U.S. like joining the military and running for office.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b35937df469c3b6f0e673df2e8be599b7b775d4564567914a397dbb31123151f"}}]}